se LORD is admitted globally. Source Lord article explicitly covers God as Lord; lowercase human lord and sentence-title Lord are not inferred from this rule.","sourceHeadwordId":"Lord","term":"LORD"}],"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","matchingRules":["reviewed_exact_headword"],"sourceProvenanceId":"Lord","sourceTitle":"Lord"}],"format":"bsb-study-chapter-v2","notes":[{"chapterAssociationStatus":"canonical_reference","content":[{"c":["The Creator-King"],"sourceClass":"theme-title","t":"h"},{"c":["God created and established the world; the whole of creation is his handiwork (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.1.1-2.25","r":"Gen.1.1-2.25","rawR":"Gen.1.1-2.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.1.1-2.25","value":"Gen.1.1-2.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gen 1–2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.24.1-2","r":"Ps.24.1-2","rawR":"Ps.24.1-2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.24.1-2","value":"Ps.24.1-2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 24:1-2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.95.4-5","r":"Ps.95.4-5","rawR":"Ps.95.4-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.95.4-5","value":"Ps.95.4-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"95:4-5"},"). He also rules over his creation, governing and caring for all that he has made (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.95.6-7","r":"Ps.95.6-7","rawR":"Ps.95.6-7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.95.6-7","value":"Ps.95.6-7"}],"t":"ref","v":"95:6-7"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.96.10","r":"Ps.96.10","rawR":"Ps.96.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.96.10","value":"Ps.96.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"96:10"},")."],"sourceClass":"theme-body-fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Several psalms celebrate the manifestation of God’s glory in creation (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.8.1-9","r":"Ps.8.1-9","rawR":"Ps.8.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.8.1-9","value":"Ps.8.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Pss 8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.19.1-14","r":"Ps.19.1-14","rawR":"Ps.19.1-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.19.1-14","value":"Ps.19.1-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.28.1-9","r":"Ps.28.1-9","rawR":"Ps.28.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.28.1-9","value":"Ps.28.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"28"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.33.1-22","r":"Ps.33.1-22","rawR":"Ps.33.1-22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.33.1-22","value":"Ps.33.1-22"}],"t":"ref","v":"33"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.89.1-52","r":"Ps.89.1-52","rawR":"Ps.89.1-52","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.89.1-52","value":"Ps.89.1-52"}],"t":"ref","v":"89"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.104.1-35","r":"Ps.104.1-35","rawR":"Ps.104.1-35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.104.1-35","value":"Ps.104.1-35"}],"t":"ref","v":"and 104"},"). ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.8.1-9","r":"Ps.8.1-9","rawR":"Ps.8.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.8.1-9","value":"Ps.8.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 8"}," centers on God’s endowing human beings with splendor and vesting them as his rulers in creation. ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.19.1-14","r":"Ps.19.1-14","rawR":"Ps.19.1-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.19.1-14","value":"Ps.19.1-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 19"}," encourages reflection on creation in order to cultivate wisdom. ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.29.1-11","r":"Ps.29.1-11","rawR":"Ps.29.1-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.29.1-11","value":"Ps.29.1-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 29"}," reveals God’s power in the world and the stability of his creation. ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.33.1-22","r":"Ps.33.1-22","rawR":"Ps.33.1-22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.33.1-22","value":"Ps.33.1-22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 33"}," exalts God’s governance, order, and wisdom in creation and underscores the importance of fearing the Lord. In ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.89.1-52","r":"Ps.89.1-52","rawR":"Ps.89.1-52","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.89.1-52","value":"Ps.89.1-52"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 89"},", God’s covenant with David is founded on God’s commitment to creation (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.89.9-18","r":"Ps.89.9-18","rawR":"Ps.89.9-18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.89.9-18","value":"Ps.89.9-18"}],"t":"ref","v":"89:9-18"},")."],"sourceClass":"theme-body","t":"p"},{"c":[{"href":"?bref=Ps.93.1-100.5","r":"Ps.93.1-100.5","rawR":"Ps.93.1-100.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.93.1-100.5","value":"Ps.93.1-100.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalms 93–100"}," reflect on God’s worldwide dominion. The earth belongs to him, and the Creator has demonstrated his power in history. ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.104.1-35","r":"Ps.104.1-35","rawR":"Ps.104.1-35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.104.1-35","value":"Ps.104.1-35"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 104"}," is a creation hymn that reworks the six days of creation into a marvelous lyric in praise of God’s wisdom."],"sourceClass":"theme-body","t":"p"},{"c":["Scripture calls upon all nations to acknowledge and praise God and to show their acceptance of his sovereign rule (see ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.9.11","r":"Ps.9.11","rawR":"Ps.9.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.9.11","value":"Ps.9.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.47.1-2","r":"Ps.47.1-2","rawR":"Ps.47.1-2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.47.1-2","value":"Ps.47.1-2"}],"t":"ref","v":"47:1-2"},", ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.47.7-9","r":"Ps.47.7-9","rawR":"Ps.47.7-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.47.7-9","value":"Ps.47.7-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"7-9"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.66.8","r":"Ps.66.8","rawR":"Ps.66.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.66.8","value":"Ps.66.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"66:8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.117.1","r":"Ps.117.1","rawR":"Ps.117.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.117.1","value":"Ps.117.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"117:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"theme-body","t":"p"},{"c":["Passages for Further Study"],"sourceClass":"theme-refs-title","t":"h"},{"c":[{"href":"?bref=Gen.1.1-2.4","r":"Gen.1.1-2.4","rawR":"Gen.1.1-2.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.1.1-2.4","value":"Gen.1.1-2.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gen 1:1–2:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.8.1-9","r":"Ps.8.1-9","rawR":"Ps.8.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.8.1-9","value":"Ps.8.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Pss 8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.19.1-14","r":"Ps.19.1-14","rawR":"Ps.19.1-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.19.1-14","value":"Ps.19.1-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.28.1-9","r":"Ps.28.1-9","rawR":"Ps.28.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.28.1-9","value":"Ps.28.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"28"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.29.1-11","r":"Ps.29.1-11","rawR":"Ps.29.1-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.29.1-11","value":"Ps.29.1-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"29"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.33.1-22","r":"Ps.33.1-22","rawR":"Ps.33.1-22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.33.1-22","value":"Ps.33.1-22"}],"t":"ref","v":"33"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.89.1-52","r":"Ps.89.1-52","rawR":"Ps.89.1-52","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.89.1-52","value":"Ps.89.1-52"}],"t":"ref","v":"89"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.93.1-100.5","r":"Ps.93.1-100.5","rawR":"Ps.93.1-100.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.93.1-100.5","value":"Ps.93.1-100.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"93–100"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.104.1-35","r":"Ps.104.1-35","rawR":"Ps.104.1-35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.104.1-35","value":"Ps.104.1-35"}],"t":"ref","v":"104"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Eccl.12.1-7","r":"Eccl.12.1-7","rawR":"Eccl.12.1-7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Eccl.12.1-7","value":"Eccl.12.1-7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Eccl 12:1-7"},", ",{"href":"?bref=Eccl.12.13-14","r":"Eccl.12.13-14","rawR":"Eccl.12.13-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Eccl.12.13-14","value":"Eccl.12.13-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"13-14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.40.25-28","r":"Isa.40.25-28","rawR":"Isa.40.25-28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.40.25-28","value":"Isa.40.25-28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Isa 40:25-28"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.43.15","r":"Isa.43.15","rawR":"Isa.43.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.43.15","value":"Isa.43.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"43:15"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.44.24","r":"Isa.44.24","rawR":"Isa.44.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.44.24","value":"Isa.44.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"44:24"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.51.13","r":"Isa.51.13","rawR":"Isa.51.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.51.13","value":"Isa.51.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"51:13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.10.16","r":"Jer.10.16","rawR":"Jer.10.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.10.16","value":"Jer.10.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 10:16"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.4.23-31","r":"Acts.4.23-31","rawR":"Acts.4.23-31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.4.23-31","value":"Acts.4.23-31"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 4:23-31"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Col.3.10","r":"Col.3.10","rawR":"Col.3.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Col.3.10","value":"Col.3.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Col 3:10"}],"sourceClass":"theme-refs","t":"p"}],"id":"ThemeNote:TheCreator-King","refs":[{"book":"PSA","endChapter":100,"endVerse":5,"startChapter":93,"startVerse":1}],"sourceAttributes":{"name":"TheCreator-King","product":"TyndaleOpenStudyNotes","typename":"ThemeNote"},"sourceBookAppCode":"PSA","sourceChapterCoverage":[93,94,95,96,97,98,99,100],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"ed9471bf5168f6dc300f05dcd288fda50f5422ef10eb1ae4048279a1ba3a77bd","sourceItemName":"TheCreator-King","sourceMember":"Tyndale Open Study Notes/ThemeNotes.xml","sourceOrder":120,"sourceReferenceException":false,"sourceReferenceMappingEvidence":{"appCode":"PSA","canonicalOSIS":"Ps","method":"official_book_intro_ref_title","sourceOSIS":"Ps"},"sourceReferenceStatus":"canonical","sourceRefsExact":"Ps.93.1-100.5","sourceRelease":"1.25","sourceTitleExact":"The Creator-King","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[],"title":"The Creator-King","type":"ThemeNote"},{"chapterAssociationStatus":"canonical_reference","content":[{"c":[{"c":[{"href":"?bref=Ps.93.1-100.5","r":"Ps.93.1-100.5","rawR":"Ps.93.1-100.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.93.1-100.5","value":"Ps.93.1-100.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Pss 93–100"}],"sourceClass":"sn-ref","t":"span"}," These psalms challenge the doubts created by the Exile (see ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.89.1-52","r":"Ps.89.1-52","rawR":"Ps.89.1-52","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.89.1-52","value":"Ps.89.1-52"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 89"},") and answer the questions asked in ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.90.11","r":"Ps.90.11","rawR":"Ps.90.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.90.11","value":"Ps.90.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"90:11"},", ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.90.13","r":"Ps.90.13","rawR":"Ps.90.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.90.13","value":"Ps.90.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"13"},". The Lord has established a kingdom (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.93.1-5","r":"Ps.93.1-5","rawR":"Ps.93.1-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.93.1-5","value":"Ps.93.1-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 93"},") that is characterized by the punishment of the wicked (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.94.1-23","r":"Ps.94.1-23","rawR":"Ps.94.1-23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.94.1-23","value":"Ps.94.1-23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 94"},"), reverent obedience among his people (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.95.1-11","r":"Ps.95.1-11","rawR":"Ps.95.1-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.95.1-11","value":"Ps.95.1-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 95"},"), justice for the poor (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.96.1-13","r":"Ps.96.1-13","rawR":"Ps.96.1-13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.96.1-13","value":"Ps.96.1-13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 96"},"), celebration in Zion (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.97.1-12","r":"Ps.97.1-12","rawR":"Ps.97.1-12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.97.1-12","value":"Ps.97.1-12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 97"},"), salvation for Israel (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.98.1-9","r":"Ps.98.1-9","rawR":"Ps.98.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.98.1-9","value":"Ps.98.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 98"},"), holiness (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.99.1-9","r":"Ps.99.1-9","rawR":"Ps.99.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.99.1-9","value":"Ps.99.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 99"},"), and praise (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.100.1-5","r":"Ps.100.1-5","rawR":"Ps.100.1-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.100.1-5","value":"Ps.100.1-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 100"},")."],"sourceClass":"sn-text","t":"p"}],"id":"StudyNote:Ps.93.1-100.5","refs":[{"book":"PSA","endChapter":100,"endVerse":5,"startChapter":93,"startVerse":1}],"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ps.93.1-100.5","product":"TyndaleOpenStudyNotes","typename":"StudyNote"},"sourceBookAppCode":"PSA","sourceChapterCoverage":[93,94,95,96,97,98,99,100],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"18ce7eafdcd2ed5de8a90ce1092dd66910bcd71ee5f794f2454756cf1614b47e","sourceItemName":"Ps.93.1-100.5","sourceMember":"Tyndale Open Study Notes/StudyNotes.xml","sourceOrder":6956,"sourceReferenceException":false,"sourceReferenceMappingEvidence":{"appCode":"PSA","canonicalOSIS":"Ps","method":"official_book_intro_ref_title","sourceOSIS":"Ps"},"sourceReferenceStatus":"canonical","sourceRefsExact":"Ps.93.1-100.5","sourceRelease":"1.25","sourceTitleExact":null,"supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[],"title":"Ps.93.1-100.5","type":"StudyNote"},{"chapterAssociationStatus":"canonical_reference","content":[{"c":[{"c":[{"href":"?bref=Ps.98.1-9","r":"Ps.98.1-9","rawR":"Ps.98.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.98.1-9","value":"Ps.98.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 98"}],"sourceClass":"sn-ref","t":"span"}," This psalm celebrates the Lord’s kingship. The Lord is Israel’s true King, its champion and savior. His people sing a new song celebrating his victorious power and faithfulness to them. The Lord displays his righteous rule to all the nations throughout the earth, which will culminate in a worldwide kingdom of justice (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.98.2","r":"Ps.98.2","rawR":"Ps.98.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.98.2","value":"Ps.98.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"98:2"},", ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.98.9","r":"Ps.98.9","rawR":"Ps.98.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.98.9","value":"Ps.98.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"9"},"). Consequently, all the earth must worship and rejoice together because the Lord is coming (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.98.4-6","r":"Ps.98.4-6","rawR":"Ps.98.4-6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.98.4-6","value":"Ps.98.4-6"}],"t":"ref","v":"98:4-6"},")."],"sourceClass":"sn-text","t":"p"}],"id":"StudyNote:Ps.98.1-9","refs":[{"book":"PSA","endChapter":98,"endVerse":9,"startChapter":98,"startVerse":1}],"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ps.98.1-9","product":"TyndaleOpenStudyNotes","typename":"StudyNote"},"sourceBookAppCode":"PSA","sourceChapterCoverage":[98],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"0963be95956d7cda6e74000bb205abaa1e67a7621320d2f9054ace0c30f0c4ea","sourceItemName":"Ps.98.1-9","sourceMember":"Tyndale Open Study Notes/StudyNotes.xml","sourceOrder":7005,"sourceReferenceException":false,"sourceReferenceMappingEvidence":{"appCode":"PSA","canonicalOSIS":"Ps","method":"official_book_intro_ref_title","sourceOSIS":"Ps"},"sourceReferenceStatus":"canonical","sourceRefsExact":"Ps.98.1-9","sourceRelease":"1.25","sourceTitleExact":null,"supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[],"title":"Ps.98.1-9","type":"StudyNote"},{"chapterAssociationStatus":"canonical_reference","content":[{"c":[{"c":[{"href":"?bref=Ps.98.2-3","r":"Ps.98.2-3","rawR":"Ps.98.2-3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.98.2-3","value":"Ps.98.2-3"}],"t":"ref","v":"98:2-3"}],"sourceClass":"sn-ref","t":"span"}," The Lord makes known his righteousness and faithfulness (see also ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.52.10","r":"Isa.52.10","rawR":"Isa.52.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.52.10","value":"Isa.52.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Isa 52:10"},")."],"sourceClass":"sn-text","t":"p"}],"id":"StudyNote:Ps.98.2-3","refs":[{"book":"PSA","endChapter":98,"endVerse":3,"startChapter":98,"startVerse":2}],"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ps.98.2-3","product":"TyndaleOpenStudyNotes","typename":"StudyNote"},"sourceBookAppCode":"PSA","sourceChapterCoverage":[98],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"f7d7bd3a3eca6373619d91336e9eba6761f15ced824047e56819ea3d7563d987","sourceItemName":"Ps.98.2-3","sourceMember":"Tyndale Open Study Notes/StudyNotes.xml","sourceOrder":7006,"sourceReferenceException":false,"sourceReferenceMappingEvidence":{"appCode":"PSA","canonicalOSIS":"Ps","method":"official_book_intro_ref_title","sourceOSIS":"Ps"},"sourceReferenceStatus":"canonical","sourceRefsExact":"Ps.98.2-3","sourceRelease":"1.25","sourceTitleExact":null,"supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[],"title":"Ps.98.2-3","type":"StudyNote"},{"chapterAssociationStatus":"canonical_reference","content":[{"c":[{"c":[{"href":"?bref=Ps.98.4-6","r":"Ps.98.4-6","rawR":"Ps.98.4-6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.98.4-6","value":"Ps.98.4-6"}],"t":"ref","v":"98:4-6"}],"sourceClass":"sn-ref","t":"span"}," The psalmist invites the whole earth to worship the King (see ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.96.1","r":"Ps.96.1","rawR":"Ps.96.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.96.1","value":"Ps.96.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"96:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"sn-text","t":"p"}],"id":"StudyNote:Ps.98.4-6","refs":[{"book":"PSA","endChapter":98,"endVerse":6,"startChapter":98,"startVerse":4}],"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ps.98.4-6","product":"TyndaleOpenStudyNotes","typename":"StudyNote"},"sourceBookAppCode":"PSA","sourceChapterCoverage":[98],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"08365594def69ea3084a0af5a2844b7701f4b2a921720ee37d16d2ad1d30e84e","sourceItemName":"Ps.98.4-6","sourceMember":"Tyndale Open Study Notes/StudyNotes.xml","sourceOrder":7007,"sourceReferenceException":false,"sourceReferenceMappingEvidence":{"appCode":"PSA","canonicalOSIS":"Ps","method":"official_book_intro_ref_title","sourceOSIS":"Ps"},"sourceReferenceStatus":"canonical","sourceRefsExact":"Ps.98.4-6","sourceRelease":"1.25","sourceTitleExact":null,"supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[],"title":"Ps.98.4-6","type":"StudyNote"},{"chapterAssociationStatus":"canonical_reference","content":[{"c":[{"c":[{"href":"?bref=Ps.98.6","r":"Ps.98.6","rawR":"Ps.98.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.98.6","value":"Ps.98.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"98:6"}],"sourceClass":"sn-ref","t":"span"}," The Temple musicians used ",{"c":["trumpets"],"sourceClass":"sn-excerpt","t":"span"}," to call people together for meetings (cp. ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.81.3","r":"Ps.81.3","rawR":"Ps.81.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.81.3","value":"Ps.81.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"81:3"},")."],"sourceClass":"sn-text","t":"p"}],"id":"StudyNote:Ps.98.6","refs":[{"book":"PSA","endChapter":98,"endVerse":6,"startChapter":98,"startVerse":6}],"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ps.98.6","product":"TyndaleOpenStudyNotes","typename":"StudyNote"},"sourceBookAppCode":"PSA","sourceChapterCoverage":[98],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"eebbd0f77825c2f67015ba055b2fd943c2055a34abf8609bf3ae04dc55295daf","sourceItemName":"Ps.98.6","sourceMember":"Tyndale Open Study Notes/StudyNotes.xml","sourceOrder":7008,"sourceReferenceException":false,"sourceReferenceMappingEvidence":{"appCode":"PSA","canonicalOSIS":"Ps","method":"official_book_intro_ref_title","sourceOSIS":"Ps"},"sourceReferenceStatus":"canonical","sourceRefsExact":"Ps.98.6","sourceRelease":"1.25","sourceTitleExact":null,"supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[],"title":"Ps.98.6","type":"StudyNote"},{"chapterAssociationStatus":"canonical_reference","content":[{"c":[{"c":[{"href":"?bref=Ps.98.7-9","r":"Ps.98.7-9","rawR":"Ps.98.7-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.98.7-9","value":"Ps.98.7-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"98:7-9"}],"sourceClass":"sn-ref","t":"span"}," The created order is personified as rejoicing at the coming of the righteous Judge (see ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.93.3-4","r":"Ps.93.3-4","rawR":"Ps.93.3-4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.93.3-4","value":"Ps.93.3-4"}],"t":"ref","v":"93:3-4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.96.11-13","r":"Ps.96.11-13","rawR":"Ps.96.11-13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.96.11-13","value":"Ps.96.11-13"}],"t":"ref","v":"96:11-13"},")."],"sourceClass":"sn-text","t":"p"}],"id":"StudyNote:Ps.98.7-9","refs":[{"book":"PSA","endChapter":98,"endVerse":9,"startChapter":98,"startVerse":7}],"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ps.98.7-9","product":"TyndaleOpenStudyNotes","typename":"StudyNote"},"sourceBookAppCode":"PSA","sourceChapterCoverage":[98],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"74eb96978af199ddd235d821a11159e86593d3b65cd01435d83bbb5df2983f35","sourceItemName":"Ps.98.7-9","sourceMember":"Tyndale Open Study Notes/StudyNotes.xml","sourceOrder":7009,"sourceReferenceException":false,"sourceReferenceMappingEvidence":{"appCode":"PSA","canonicalOSIS":"Ps","method":"official_book_intro_ref_title","sourceOSIS":"Ps"},"sourceReferenceStatus":"canonical","sourceRefsExact":"Ps.98.7-9","sourceRelease":"1.25","sourceTitleExact":null,"supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[],"title":"Ps.98.7-9","type":"StudyNote"}],"version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}